                                                "sense_id": "75c058e6-ab62-35c0-95f2-5de8fc1d2fcd",
                                                "text": "My favorite Greek cheese is the creamy, sheepy manouri: delicately scented and almost spreadable, it’s like a softer, pudgier feta."
